{"strongs": "H0727", "word": "אֲרוֺן", "translit": "a.ron", "root": "ארון", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "chest, ark", "definition": "אֲרוֺן , with article הָאָרוֺן , הָאָרֹן 203 noun masculine Exod 35:12 ( feminine 1Sam 4:17 ; 2Chr 8:11 ) chest, ark (Phoenician ארן , sarcophagus , Assyrian êrênu (& êrû) chest Zim BP 6, 22 , Arabic , chest , so Aramaic , also Nabataean ארנא , Vog p. 102, Phoenician ; Mishna also plural ארונות ) — only singular; absolute אֲרוֺן 2Kgs 12:10 = 2Chr 24:8 with article הָאָרוֺן Deut 10:2 + always except Exodus Leviticus Numbers where הָאָרֹן ( Exod 25:14 (twice in verse) + 13 t. Exodus; Lev 16:2 ; Num 3:31 ; Num 10:35 ); construct אֲרוֺן Exod 25:10 +, אֲרֹן Exod 30:6 ; Num 4:5 ; Num 7:89 — 1. chest , for money-offerings 2Kgs 12:10 ; 2Kgs 12:11 ; 2Chr 24:8 ; 2Chr 24:10 ; 2Chr 24:11 (twice in verse). 2. sarcophagus, mummy-case of Joseph Gen 50:26 ( E ). 3. chest, ark in tabernacle & temple, containing tables of law, with cherubim above, the especially seat of ׳ י among his people, only Hexateuch (71 t.) Samuel (61 t.) Kings (12 t.) & Chronicles (48 t.) + Judg 20:27 ; Jer 3:16 ; Ps 132:8 used alone & in various combinations (compare Seyring ZAW 1891, 114 f. ). \\ \\ a. indefinite אֲרוֺן עֲצֵי שִׁטִּים an ark of shittim-wood Exod 25:10 ; Deut 10:3 compare v Deut 10:1 . \\ \\ b. def. ׳ הָא Exod 25:14 + 54 t. (Hexateuch P , except Joshua J E ; Samuel Kings Chronicles). \\ \\ c. יהוה ׳ א Josh 4:11 + 32 t. Joshua ( J E D ) Samuel Kings Chronicles. \\ \\ d. ׳ א אֱלֹהִים 1Sam 3:3 ; 1Sam 4:11 הָאֱלֹהִים ׳ א 1Sam 4:13 + 32 t. Samuel, Chronicles (but 1Sam 14:18 (twice in verse) read הָאֵפוֺד ᵐ5 We Dr ), compare אֱלֹהֵינוּ ׳ א 1Chr 13:3 . \\ \\ e. אלהי יִשְׂרָאֵל ׳ א 1Sam 5:7 + 6 t. Samuel, term used only by Philistines; יהוה אלהי יִשְׂרָאֵל ׳ א 1Chr 15:12 ; 1Chr 15:14 יהוה אֱלֹהֵיכֶם ׳ א Josh 4:5 ( J E ); ׳ א אֲדֹנָי יהוה 1Kgs 2:26 יחוה אֲדוֺן כָּלהָֿאָרֶץ ׳ א Josh 3:13 ( J E D ) compare אדון כלהֿארץ [ הברית ] ׳ א v Josh 3:11 , where הברית (with article) is probably interpolated, see Di ; only once & late the long phrase האלהים יהוה יוֺשֵׁב ׳ א הַכְּרוּבִים אֲשֶׁר נִקְרָאשֵֿׁם 1Chr 13:6 . feminine in combination with בְּרִית , largely D & under D's influence; ארון הַבְּרִית ark of the covenant Josh 3:6 (twice in verse); Josh 3:8 ; Josh 4:9 ; Josh 6:6 (all J E D ); בְּרִית יהוה ׳ א Num 10:33 ; Num 14:44 (both J ) Deut 10:8 ; Deut 31:9 ; Deut 31:25 ; Josh 4:7 ; Josh 4:18 ; Josh 6:8 ; Josh 8:33 ; Jer 3:16 + 17 t. Samuel Kings Chronicles; once longer צְבָאוֺת ישֵׁב הַכְּרֻבִים ׳ בְּרִית י ׳ א 1Sam 4:4 also בְּרִית הָאֱלֹהִים ׳ א Judg 20:27 ; 1Sam 4:4 ; 2Sam 15:24 ; 1Chr 16:6 & אלהיכם ׳ בְּרִית א ׳ א Deut 31:26 ; Josh 3:3 . \\ \\ g. אֲרוֺן הָעֵדוּת ark of the testimony , only in P , corresponding to בְּרִית ׳ א (compare Di on Exod 25:16 ), Exod 25:22 + 8 t. Exodus; Num 4:5 ; Num 7:84 ; Josh 4:16 . \\ \\ h. הַקֹּדֶשׁ ׳ א 2Chr 35:3 . \\ \\ i. עֻזֶּךָ֑ ׳ א the ark of thy strength 2Chr 6:41 ; Ps 132:8 . — (compare also tables given by Seyring l.c. & his theory as to earliest designation of ark .) אַרְנֶ֫בֶת see אנב . ארניה see אֲרַוְנָה .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB777')\">BDB777</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H727')\">H727</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB776')\">BDB776</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB778')\">BDB778</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>אֲרוֺן</bdbheb>, with article <bdbheb>הָאָרוֺן</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>הָאָרֹן</bdbheb><sub>203</sub> <b>noun masculine</b><sup><ref ref=\"Exod 35:12\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(2,35,12)\">Exod 35:12</ref></sup> (<b>feminine</b><sup><ref ref=\"1Sam 4:17\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(9,4,17)\">1Sam 4:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 8:11\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(14,8,11)\">2Chr 8:11</ref></sup>) <highlightword>chest, ark</highlightword> (Phoenician <bdbheb>ארן</bdbheb>, <highlight>sarcophagus</highlight>, Assyrian <transliteration><highlight>êrênu (&amp; êrû) chest</highlight></transliteration> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Zim')\">Zim<sup>BP 6, 22</sup></lookup>, Arabic <placeholder419/>, <highlight>chest</highlight>, so Aramaic <placeholder420/>, also Nabataean <bdbheb>ארנא</bdbheb>, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Vog')\">Vog<sup>p. 102, Phoenician</sup></lookup>; Mishna also plural <bdbheb>ארונות</bdbheb>) — only singular; absolute <bdbheb>אֲרוֺן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 12:10\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(12,12,10)\">2Kgs 12:10</ref> = <ref ref=\"2Chr 24:8\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(14,24,8)\">2Chr 24:8</ref> with article <bdbheb>הָאָרוֺן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 10:2\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(5,10,2)\">Deut 10:2</ref> + always except Exodus Leviticus Numbers where <bdbheb>הָאָרֹן</bdbheb> (<ref ref=\"Exod 25:14\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(2,25,14)\">Exod 25:14</ref> (twice in verse) + 13 t. Exodus; <ref ref=\"Lev 16:2\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(3,16,2)\">Lev 16:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 3:31\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(4,3,31)\">Num 3:31</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 10:35\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"35\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"35\" onclick=\"bcv(4,10,35)\">Num 10:35</ref>); construct <bdbheb>אֲרוֺן</bdbheb><ref ref=\"Exod 25:10\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(2,25,10)\">Exod 25:10</ref> +, <bdbheb>אֲרֹן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 30:6\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(2,30,6)\">Exod 30:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 4:5\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(4,4,5)\">Num 4:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 7:89\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"89\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"89\" onclick=\"bcv(4,7,89)\">Num 7:89</ref> — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>chest</highlight>, for money-offerings <ref ref=\"2Kgs 12:10\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(12,12,10)\">2Kgs 12:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 12:11\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(12,12,11)\">2Kgs 12:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 24:8\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(14,24,8)\">2Chr 24:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 24:10\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(14,24,10)\">2Chr 24:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 24:11\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(14,24,11)\">2Chr 24:11</ref> (twice in verse). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>sarcophagus, mummy-case</highlight> of Joseph <ref ref=\"Gen 50:26\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"50\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"50\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(1,50,26)\">Gen 50:26</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> <highlight>chest, ark</highlight> in tabernacle &amp; temple, containing tables of law, with cherubim above, the especially seat of <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> among his people, only Hexateuch (71 t.) Samuel (61 t.) Kings (12 t.) &amp; Chronicles (48 t.) + <ref ref=\"Judg 20:27\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(7,20,27)\">Judg 20:27</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 3:16\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(24,3,16)\">Jer 3:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 132:8\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"132\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"132\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(19,132,8)\">Ps 132:8</ref> used alone &amp; in various combinations (compare Seyring<sup>ZAW 1891, 114 f.</sup>). <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> indefinite <bdbheb>אֲרוֺן עֲצֵי שִׁטִּים</bdbheb> <highlight>an ark of shittim-wood</highlight> <ref ref=\"Exod 25:10\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(2,25,10)\">Exod 25:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 10:3\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(5,10,3)\">Deut 10:3</ref> compare v<ref ref=\"Deut 10:1\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(5,10,1)\">Deut 10:1</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> def. <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>הָא</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 25:14\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(2,25,14)\">Exod 25:14</ref> + 54 t. (Hexateuch <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>, except Joshua <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>; Samuel Kings Chronicles). <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> <bdbheb>יהוה</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Josh 4:11\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(6,4,11)\">Josh 4:11</ref> + 32 t. Joshua (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('D')\"><reflink>D</reflink></lookup>) Samuel Kings Chronicles. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>d.</b> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> <bdbheb>אֱלֹהִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 3:3\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(9,3,3)\">1Sam 3:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 4:11\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(9,4,11)\">1Sam 4:11</ref> <bdbheb>הָאֱלֹהִים</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb><ref ref=\"1Sam 4:13\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(9,4,13)\">1Sam 4:13</ref> + 32 t. Samuel, Chronicles (but <ref ref=\"1Sam 14:18\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(9,14,18)\">1Sam 14:18</ref> (twice in verse) read <bdbheb>הָאֵפוֺד</bdbheb> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('We')\">We</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dr')\">Dr</lookup>), compare <bdbheb>אֱלֹהֵינוּ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Chr 13:3\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(13,13,3)\">1Chr 13:3</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>e.</b> <bdbheb>אלהי יִשְׂרָאֵל</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 5:7\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(9,5,7)\">1Sam 5:7</ref> + 6 t. Samuel, term used only by Philistines; <bdbheb>יהוה אלהי יִשְׂרָאֵל</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Chr 15:12\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(13,15,12)\">1Chr 15:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 15:14\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(13,15,14)\">1Chr 15:14</ref> <bdbheb>יהוה אֱלֹהֵיכֶם</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Josh 4:5\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(6,4,5)\">Josh 4:5</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup><lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>); <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> <bdbheb>אֲדֹנָי יהוה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 2:26\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(11,2,26)\">1Kgs 2:26</ref> <bdbheb>יחוה אֲדוֺן כָּלהָֿאָרֶץ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Josh 3:13\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(6,3,13)\">Josh 3:13</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('D')\"><reflink>D</reflink></lookup>) compare <bdbheb>אדון כלהֿארץ</bdbheb> [<bdbheb>הברית</bdbheb>] <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"Josh 3:11\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(6,3,11)\">Josh 3:11</ref>, where <bdbheb>הברית</bdbheb> (with article) is probably interpolated, see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Di')\">Di</lookup>; only once &amp; late the long phrase <bdbheb>האלהים יהוה יוֺשֵׁב</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> <bdbheb>הַכְּרוּבִים אֲשֶׁר נִקְרָאשֵֿׁם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Chr 13:6\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(13,13,6)\">1Chr 13:6</ref>. <b>feminine</b> <highlightword>in combination with</highlightword> <bdbheb>בְּרִית</bdbheb>, largely <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('D')\"><reflink>D</reflink></lookup> &amp; under D's influence; <bdbheb>ארון הַבְּרִית</bdbheb> <highlight>ark of the covenant</highlight> <ref ref=\"Josh 3:6\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(6,3,6)\">Josh 3:6</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"Josh 3:8\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(6,3,8)\">Josh 3:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 4:9\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(6,4,9)\">Josh 4:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 6:6\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(6,6,6)\">Josh 6:6</ref> (all <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('D')\"><reflink>D</reflink></lookup>); <bdbheb>בְּרִית יהוה</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 10:33\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(4,10,33)\">Num 10:33</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 14:44\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"44\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"44\" onclick=\"bcv(4,14,44)\">Num 14:44</ref> (both <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>) <ref ref=\"Deut 10:8\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(5,10,8)\">Deut 10:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 31:9\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(5,31,9)\">Deut 31:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 31:25\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(5,31,25)\">Deut 31:25</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 4:7\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(6,4,7)\">Josh 4:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 4:18\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(6,4,18)\">Josh 4:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 6:8\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(6,6,8)\">Josh 6:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 8:33\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(6,8,33)\">Josh 8:33</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 3:16\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(24,3,16)\">Jer 3:16</ref> + 17 t. Samuel Kings Chronicles; once longer <bdbheb>צְבָאוֺת ישֵׁב הַכְּרֻבִים</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>בְּרִית י</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 4:4\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(9,4,4)\">1Sam 4:4</ref> also <bdbheb>בְּרִית הָאֱלֹהִים</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 20:27\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(7,20,27)\">Judg 20:27</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 4:4\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(9,4,4)\">1Sam 4:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 15:24\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(10,15,24)\">2Sam 15:24</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 16:6\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(13,16,6)\">1Chr 16:6</ref> &amp; <bdbheb>אלהיכם</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>בְּרִית א</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 31:26\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(5,31,26)\">Deut 31:26</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 3:3\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(6,3,3)\">Josh 3:3</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>g.</b> <bdbheb>אֲרוֺן הָעֵ